      "post": {
        "description": "Requires exact allowed Origin, JSON and Idempotency-Key. Canonical trimmed Unicode name is hashed with SHA-256; identity-scoped retries replay the committed workspace after fresh membership authorization, conflicting content returns 409. Ledger retention is at least 24 hours. All responses are no-store.",
