      "post": {
        "description": "Requires allowed Origin, JSON and Idempotency-Key. Fresh write membership is checked under workspace shared lock before actor-scoped create replay. SHA-256 canonical payload and committed response share a 24-hour ledger and atomic transaction. Twelve cryptographic random bytes yield lowercase unpadded base32 keys, with at most five retries only on the named global host/key constraint, including deleted rows. Optional ASCII customKey is lowercased and validated as 3–64 characters with system paths reserved; global collisions return KEY_UNAVAILABLE without owner data and changed canonical payload returns REQUEST_REUSE_CONFLICT. Public HTTP(S) destinations only; no fetch or preview. All responses are no-store.",
        "operationId": "createLink",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "in": "path",
            "name": "workspaceId",
            "required": true,
